WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.570 --> 00:00:02.239
- [Interviewer] So anyway,
where are you from originally?

00:00:02.239 --> 00:00:03.567
- Houston, Texas.

00:00:03.567 --> 00:00:04.510
- [Interviewer] Houston.

00:00:04.510 --> 00:00:05.830
And how long you been out here?

00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:07.230
- [Honey Bun] For almost too months.

00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:09.070
- [Interviewer] Oh, you're brand new.

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:11.543
And what brought you out to LA?

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:13.730
- [Honey Bun] To get in this rehab program

00:00:13.730 --> 00:00:14.577
called (indistinct).

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:17.679
- [Interviewer] Yeah, down the street.

00:00:17.679 --> 00:00:19.580
What's your drug?

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:20.600
- Crack.

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:21.850
- [Interviewer] Crack, how
long you been doing that?

00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:25.363
- On and off from about 18, 19 years.

00:00:26.497 --> 00:00:27.800
- [Interviewer] Wow,
what age did you start?

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:31.760
- I just relapsed when I got
out of here July the 5th.

00:00:33.230 --> 00:00:35.150
I was six and a half years clean.

00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:36.467
- [Interviewer] You were clean?

00:00:36.467 --> 00:00:37.340
- For six and a half years.

00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:38.950
- [Interviewer] What
triggered you to go back?

00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:41.400
- The people, people, places and things.

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:42.575
- [Interviewer] Life.

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:44.708
- Yes.

00:00:44.708 --> 00:00:47.435
- [Interviewer] And stress.

00:00:47.435 --> 00:00:48.268
And tell me about your childhood.

00:00:48.268 --> 00:00:50.140
Did you grow up with one
parent, both parents?

00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:51.590
- I growed up with my mother.

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:57.633
She was a hard black and working woman.

00:00:58.480 --> 00:01:00.930
She made sure we got our
education and graduated.

00:01:03.010 --> 00:01:04.050
- [Interviewer] What was the house like?

00:01:04.050 --> 00:01:05.600
You have brothers and sisters?

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:08.300
- I had a twin brother and
a 40-some year old brother.

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:10.960
It was good.

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:14.966
I had a good living
until my mother passed.

00:01:14.966 --> 00:01:16.545
- [Interviewer] When
did your mom pass away?

00:01:16.545 --> 00:01:19.045
- 2002, October the 1st, 2002.

00:01:20.890 --> 00:01:22.200
- [Interviewer] So how old were you then?

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:23.033
- 22.

00:01:25.890 --> 00:01:27.560
- [Interviewer] And where
did you go from there?

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:30.743
- In and out of prison,
jumping state to state.

00:01:32.550 --> 00:01:34.000
Now in California.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:35.670
- [Interviewer] What
were you in prison for?

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:37.670
- [Honey Bun] Prostitution,
aggravated assault

00:01:37.670 --> 00:01:40.923
with a deadly weapon, attempted murder.

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:42.780
- [Interviewer] Attempted murder?

00:01:42.780 --> 00:01:44.300
Tell me about that.

00:01:44.300 --> 00:01:46.121
- [Honey Bun] Well, I was out there

00:01:46.121 --> 00:01:47.780
whoring, scoring and blowing.

00:01:47.780 --> 00:01:51.400
And this trick thought he
was just gonna take my area

00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:53.810
of my body, and wasn't having it,

00:01:53.810 --> 00:01:55.740
so I shot him in his nick

00:01:58.990 --> 00:02:00.550
and I shot him in the back of the head.

00:02:00.550 --> 00:02:01.690
But he survived.

00:02:01.690 --> 00:02:03.440
He pulled through.

00:02:03.440 --> 00:02:05.377
- [Interviewer] How many
years did you do for that?

00:02:05.377 --> 00:02:06.330
- [Honey Bun] No, it was self-defense,

00:02:06.330 --> 00:02:07.730
since they had it on camera.

00:02:09.290 --> 00:02:10.810
- [Interviewer] So you didn't do any time?

00:02:10.810 --> 00:02:14.500
- [Honey Bun] No, I just stayed in county

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:16.650
for almost two years
of fighting that case.

00:02:18.823 --> 00:02:20.382
- [Interviewer] And do you
have children of your own?

00:02:20.382 --> 00:02:23.123
- [Honey Bun] No, I'm 39
with no children, no kids.

00:02:25.110 --> 00:02:27.120
- [Interviewer] And what do you
see for your life from here?

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:28.320
What do you want to do?

00:02:28.320 --> 00:02:30.060
- [Honey Bun] I want
to get off the streets.

00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:34.383
I want to go back home so
I can get it back together.

00:02:34.383 --> 00:02:38.127
- [Interviewer] You did it once before.

00:02:38.127 --> 00:02:41.931
Do you still have contact
with your family at all?

00:02:41.931 --> 00:02:42.781
- [Honey Bun] No.

00:02:48.050 --> 00:02:50.920
- [Interviewer] How did you
first get introduced to crack?

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:53.360
- I used to see my auntie smoke it.

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:56.802
When we was about eight or
nine, me and my twin brother,

00:02:56.802 --> 00:02:59.290
my aunt used to have
me and my twin brother

00:02:59.290 --> 00:03:00.240
fix her crack pipes

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:02.001
so we already knew how to fix 'em up

00:03:02.001 --> 00:03:03.150
and we used to see her.

00:03:03.150 --> 00:03:04.520
And I got curious one day.

00:03:04.520 --> 00:03:07.660
I was 16, turning 17, in 11th grade,

00:03:09.550 --> 00:03:11.690
and I got curious one
day and I wanted to see

00:03:11.690 --> 00:03:14.031
what the crack do to make my auntie

00:03:14.031 --> 00:03:16.181
destroy my whole granny
house (indistinct),

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:23.090
to see what make her take
everything out room by room,

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:25.400
one at a time, to search
for money and stuff.

00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:27.210
I wanted to see what make her do all that,

00:03:27.210 --> 00:03:29.660
why the crack make her do
that and now I see why.

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:31.513
- [Interviewer] So you've seen

00:03:31.513 --> 00:03:34.030
all kinds of crazy stuff at night.

00:03:34.030 --> 00:03:36.163
What kind of stuff have you seen and done?

00:03:37.123 --> 00:03:38.677
- I have been raped, robbed,

00:03:38.677 --> 00:03:41.274
and ran down the street buck naked.

00:03:41.274 --> 00:03:43.600
(indistinct) prostitutes and tricks

00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:46.700
been on a freeway and
didn't care, having sex.

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:48.023
I've seen a lot of stuff.

00:03:51.105 --> 00:03:51.938
- [Interviewer] How much money do you make

00:03:51.938 --> 00:03:53.250
typically in a night?

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:54.690
- Every night?

00:03:54.690 --> 00:03:56.817
About four something.

00:03:56.817 --> 00:03:57.720
- [Interviewer] $400?

00:03:57.720 --> 00:03:59.600
- 400-some dollars.

00:03:59.600 --> 00:04:01.124
- [Interviewer] How many guys is that?

00:04:01.124 --> 00:04:02.207
- That's six.

00:04:03.925 --> 00:04:05.987
- [Interviewer] It's pretty good.

00:04:05.987 --> 00:04:07.737
And that pays for your crack habit?

00:04:08.670 --> 00:04:12.187
- And my room, clothing
and food, and hygiene.

00:04:19.144 --> 00:04:20.680
- [Interviewer] Well, be safe out there.

00:04:20.680 --> 00:04:21.854
Good luck with everything.

00:04:21.854 --> 00:04:22.687
- Thank you.

00:04:22.687 --> 00:04:23.705
- [Interviewer] Hope you get clean.

00:04:23.705 --> 00:04:25.075
- Pray for me.

00:04:25.075 --> 00:04:26.483
- [Interviewer] Thank you.

00:04:26.483 --> 00:04:27.483
- Thank you.

